    "body": "So, how will that work? If we display first week as \"Sat, Sun\" (because minDays=2 for a given locale) and then second week from Mon till Sun, and the user marks Week 2, should we send \"Week 1\" or \"Week 2\" to the server?\n\nFrom what you're saying, we should send \"Week 1\", and if the user will mark \"Week 1\", we should send the last week of the previous year.\nAm I interpreting your words correctly?\n",
